{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“广义相对论中的复几何”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"广义相对论中的复几何"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Einstein场方程","text":"Einstein 场方程"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Ric}=\\lambda g\r\n$$</p>\n<p>复度规的符号是 $0$:\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\tds^2 &amp;= (dz_1)^2 +\\cdots+(dz_n)^2\\\\\r\n\t&amp;=(dx_1)^2+\\cdots+(dx_n)^2 -(dy_1)^2-\\cdots-(dy_n)^2 +\r\n\t2i(dx_1dy_1+\\cdots)\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>想象 "},{"Local":{"url":"Minkowski时空","text":"Minkowski 时空"}},{"Plain":"是复空间的一个切片, 作 "},{"Local":{"url":"Wick旋转","text":"Wick 旋转"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>点源的复变换 (?)</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"广义相对论","text":"广义相对论"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}